{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54999","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 二十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军邑（京本作「营口」）内，天上忽闻声。\n恰是（京本作「似」）雷声还不是（京本作「似」），多应（京本作「因」）土地见英（京本作「现阴」）灵，不久（京本作「是」）战兵行（京本作「兴」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}